## Title: Crown And Crux
## Description: Adds a movable crux counter and an enlarged group leader crown symbol. The crown can be toggled off in settings and the counter can be toggled to always show. Adds a marker to downed team members that can be toggled off.
## APIVersion: 101049 101050
## Author: SaintAres97
